# Trial-Size Trial by Fire (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_fire): entryRequirement. Main, a level 20 Warrior with the quest accepted and
# the MiniTuningForkOfFire: FP_Entrance: not a Summoner: no options: the default. bob, a level 19 Summoner: below 20: no options.
lists CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrade
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=WAR lvl=20
char bob zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=SMN lvl=19
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByFire accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfFire
bob: item MiniTuningForkOfFire
login
trade FP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfFire x1  # not a Summoner: no options
bob: login
bob: trade FP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfFire x1  # level 19: no options
